`,c.jsx(u.p,{children:"Next, I wanted to explore using an animation library I found called Motion. With this, I can add animations within the JSX, which really simplifies the process of creating animations. I started creating some flip card animations on the main page, which provide a brief description of each subpage and encourage the user to click them."}),`
